'''Bird of light beacon''' is a light-type spell used to create a flying bird of light.{{Ref|m|11}}

==Description==
Bird of light beacon contains a central light sigil with a dispersion keystone on one side, and a bird keystone on the other three. The spell produces a bird made from light that will fly around for some time, and can be used to either entertain, call for help, or distract.{{Ref|m|11}}

==Usage==
During the rescue at the river, [[Agott]] used this  spell to distract the [[Unknowing|unknowing]] in the area so [[Coco]] could preform magic to save [[Coustas]] without being seen, as well as to call for help.{{Ref|m|11}}

